  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "c3525026-58e8-41cc-a0b1-b900d9b8d442"],
 "\[LineSeparator]",
 "uses the given degree."
}], "Usage",ExpressionUUID->"9de5d10f-2a17-46ef-b08c-83e122694549"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Feeding the result to ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["MaurerCartanEquation"]], 
     "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/MaurerCartanEquation", 
     "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", 
   RowBox[{"\[Ellipsis]", ",", " ", "\"\<Equations\>\""}], "]"}]], 
  "InlineFormula",
  FontSize->0.9 Inherited,ExpressionUUID->
  "283e59de-3c8b-4c17-9abf-989a65faad94"],
 " gives the equations the unknowns must satisfy \[LongDash] the round trip \
from an element to its equations and back."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"9bbeeb4c-5ffb-40e3-99f3-5265a3ffb41e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The coefficients are indexed by ",
 StyleBox["position",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " in the basis, not by the monomial. A coefficient carrying a ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["CyclicWord"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/CyclicWord", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "148006f1-cddb-40e6-9501-c5fe6a830132"],
 " inside it is rewritten along with everything else when the expression is \
handed to the engine, and the engine then stops recognizing it as a scalar, \
so the operations cease to be linear in it and come back unevaluated. Any \
coefficient free of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["CyclicWord"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/CyclicWord", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "dac0adf0-cdc6-469c-a55b-8c72180ed25d"],
 " and ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["HBar"]], "paclet:ChernSimons/ref/HBar", 
    "ChernSimons Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "ec2910a9-8be4-43f1-89f6-3db5932cfb86"],
 " is safe."
}], "Notes",ExpressionUUID->"bcb938d9-2750-4829-97b1-0c6201f3d18f"]
}, Open  ]],

